From: qr0n <77075118+qr0n@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 01:54:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] p100: STRATA_Q8_SM60_H2=1, the Q8_0 verify dot in fp16
 (HFMA2) on the q8sm60 planes

Opt-in beside STRATA_Q8_SM60=1. Standalone (tools/q8_sm60_h2_check.cu, P100): +15-35% GB/s at
4-6 columns on the 2560-wide matrices; in the engine (atomic pack, 2x P100) dense stage 11.48 ->
10.86 ms per window, ~1% of a window. Parked: not a measurable end-to-end win.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
